e so strong, we feel like we're in a good position this year to take price related to our merchandise margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/04/09/ollies-bargain-outlet-olli-q4-2017-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"OLLI 2018 Q3","e":"olli","d":"2018-12-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark Butler","x":"And as we previously have mentioned, the tariffs -- we have some minor impact to some of the product that we do sell, we bring in, we do sell.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/12/04/ollies-bargain-outlet-holdings-inc-olli-q3-2018-ea.aspx"},{"c":"OLLI 2018 Q3","e":"olli","d":"2018-12-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark Butler","x":"But by and large, the tariffs don't have a major effect to us because we are not a price setter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/12/04/ollies-bargain-outlet-holdings-inc-olli-q3-2018-ea.aspx"},{"c":"OLLI 2018 Q4","e":"olli","d":"2019-03-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jay Stasz","x":"We did bring in some air conditioners and things early that we've talked about to try to avoid the tariffs, but really nothing material that would cause a swing in the inventory.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/03/26/ollies-bargain-outlet-holdings-inc-olli-q4-2018-ea.aspx"},{"c":"OLLI 2018 Q4","e":"olli","d":"2019-03-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jay Stasz","x":"And the way we record the tariffs for us, it actually flows through on the supply chain side.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/03/26/ollies-bargain-outlet-holdings-inc-olli-q4-2018-ea.aspx"},{"c":"OLLI 2019 Q3","e":"olli","d":"2019-12-10","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"John Swygert","x":"Well, I would -- I don't know if we've seen a big pickup related to tariffs at this point in time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/12/10/ollies-bargain-outlet-holdings-olli-q3-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"OLLI 2019 Q3","e":"olli","d":"2019-12-10","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Paul Lejuez","x":"Curious if you are seeing outsized product availability in any specific categories as a result of tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/12/10/ollies-bargain-outlet-holdings-olli-q3-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"OLLI 2019 Q3","e":"olli","d":"2019-12-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jay Stasz","x":"Based on Q3 results and our expectations for Q4, we are reaffirming the full-year guidance that we provided on our prior call, which is detailed in our earnings release.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/12/10/ollies-bargain-outlet-holdings-olli-q3-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"OLLI 2025 Q1","e":"olli","d":"2025-06-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Helm","x":"It also assumes that current tariffs in effect remain in place for the balance of this fiscal year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/03/ollies-olli-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OLLI 2025 Q1","e":"olli","d":"2025-06-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Eric VanderVlok","x":"…pressure on retailers and suppliers who are having challenging moments in planning their business, and we think there'll be even more product available as we move into the back half of the year related to some of what I consider, you know, supply chain disruption, you know, related to tariff.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/03/ollies-olli-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OLLI 2025 Q1","e":"olli","d":"2025-06-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Eric VanderVlok","x":"Or if they'll try to take price in consumables, what that means ultimately to the product pipeline.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/03/ollies-olli-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OLLI 2025 Q1","e":"olli","d":"2025-06-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Eric VanderVlok","x":"I'd like having the pricing power, Randy, to be candid.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/03/ollies-olli-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OLLI 2025 Q2","e":"olli","d":"2025-08-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert F. Helm","x":"Our updated outlook also assumes the current tariffs remain in place for the balance of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/09/02/ollies-olli-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OLLI 2025 Q2","e":"olli","d":"2025-08-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Eric van der Valk","x":"Tariffs have created uncertainty in the market, which is disruptive.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/09/02/ollies-olli-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OLLI 2025 Q2","e":"olli","d":"2025-08-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Eric van der Valk","x":"New store openings, total sales, comparable store sales, and adjusted earnings were all ahead of our expectations, and we are raising our full-year outlook across the board.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/09/02/ollies-olli-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OLLI 2025 Q4","e":"olli","d":"2026-03-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Helm","x":"Let me start with tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/12/ollies-olli-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OLLI 2025 Q4","e":"olli","d":"2026-03-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Helm","x":"The tariff situation obviously remains very fluid, and the current lower levels could be temporary.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/12/ollies-olli-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OLLI 2026 Q1","e":"olli","d":"2026-06-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Helm","x":"Higher fuel costs were more than offset by lower tariff expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/04/ollies-olli-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OLLI 2026 Q